OL,3,AKing and Macron view historic Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry exhibition in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles, French President Emmanuel
OL,7,FMacron and UK Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham are being shown the landmark
OL,9,FBayeux Tapestry exhibition at the
OL,10,FBritish Museum.
OL,12,FThe visit on Wednesday evening comes
OL,13,Fahead of the medieval tapestry going on
OL,14,Fpublic display in London from 10
OL,15,FSeptember, which seems set to be one of
OL,16,Fthe blockbuster cultural events of the
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
