OL,3,AKing and Macron view historic Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry exhibition in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 70m (230ft) tapestry, originally
OL,7,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,8,Fcenturies in France, tells the story of
OL,9,Fthe Norman Conquest and the Battle of
OL,10,FHastings in 1066.
OL,12,FPresident Macron said the loan of the
OL,13,Fnational treasure until July 2027 was a
OL,14,F"powerful symbol" of the close ties
OL,15,Fbetween the UK and France.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
